Static template assets:
- Capture_it.ttf — "Capture it" by Cpr.Sparhelt, free for personal/
  commercial use, can't be resold directly (see the DaFont license text
  that shipped with it)
- logo.png — the "S" monogram, cropped/keyed out of the blank cover
  template PNG. Placeholder until the official logo files are provided.
- closer.mp4 — final carousel slide (logo + "FOLLOW FOR MORE" +
  "808DYSTOPIA"), reused as-is, not rendered. Already 1080x1350 H.264/AAC
  MP4 — Instagram-compatible with no conversion needed.
